            "review_title": "Review at KATINAT Nguyễn Văn Thoại Đà Nẵng",
            "review_text": "Lycian\nSeoul, South Korea77 contributions\n0\nMy Own Base Camp Near My Khe Beach\nMay 2026 • Solo\nCame here on a hot afternoon in Da Nang and it was exactly what I needed! Located right near My Khe Beach, this place is a perfect chill spot. The interior is clean, bright, and has that trendy Korean cafe vibe — super Instagrammable. I ordered coconut water but they brought me coconut coffee instead. Luckily, it was really delicious. The staff were busy but still very friendly and even helped me watch my bag when I went to the restroom. WiFi was fast and there are plenty of outlets for charging devices. It felt like a comfortable base camp where I could rest and recharge during my trip. Highly recommended!\n\n한국적인 인테리어에\n친절한 서비스\n좋은 메뉴들 모든 게 만족스럽습니다\nRead more\nWritten May 5, 2026",
